      "body": "On December 26, 2025, Family Care Hospitals Limited closed the transaction. The company issued 18,677,500 convertible warrants at a price if INR 2.5 for aggregate gross proceeds of INR 46,693,750. The transaction has been approved by the board of directors. The transaction included participation from Dealmoney Commodities Private Limited for 18,000,000 warrants amounting to INR 45,000,000, Kasbekar Swati for 300,000 warrants amounting to INR 750,000, Tripti Pranesh Puri for 300,000 warrants amounting to INR 750,000 and other individual investors.",
